## Copied into the browser bundle via scripts/generate-environment.mjs — no secrets here.
##
## Usage:
## - Copy to `.env` and adjust (see also optional `.env.development` / `.env.production`).
## - `npm ci` runs `prepare` → generates `development` config for lint/tests.
## - `npm run build` generates `production` then runs `ng build`.

# API base URL (no trailing slash on path roots; include scheme)
API_URL=http://localhost
